  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Corrections release. 2.0.0 shipped documentation that did not compile and a\n\t\t\tPostgreSQL schema missing its state and lease_id columns:\n\t\t\t- AddCoreIdempotencyRedis and AddCoreIdempotencyPostgreSql examples in the README\n\t\t\t  showed a parameterless call; both methods require a configuration delegate.\n\t\t\tThe provider never created its schema. The documented idempotency_keys table\n\t\t\t  predated the lease contract and failed on the first request.\n\t\t\tThe PostgreSQL package now ships scripts/postgres.sql.\n\t\t\tAlso: XML documentation is published, SourceLink is enabled, and the package\n\t\t\tmetadata URLs were corrected.",
